WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.306
Baabiraawo maako jippi diga asama. Gooto kaalanol kassena.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.250
Luttuɗum, dow duule ɗon woodi lesdi daga dow. Walaa kooɗume.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.776
O ɗon yi'a duniyaaru dow, o ƴiwoyi nder duule.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:46.264
O ɗon yi'a bee debbo maako duniyaaru ndu walaa goɗɗum, walaa daande, wala wolde.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.736
Ɗu'um waɗi kuuje ɗe cembiɗini dow leydi, nden ɓe puɗɗi wurtaago.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.784
Ɗuum waɗi duuɓi ɗuuɗɗi, ɓe njotti hakkunde asama e duniyaaru.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:24.008
Yimɓe ɓe'e nder lesdi ladde, haa nokkuure nde Tibeel jooɗoto.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:38.426
Luttudu ɗon maaki. Walaa ko wuurtata to ndiyam walaa.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.416
Toowe daga lesdi dow, wari haa am!

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.008
Sey duule ɗen udditi, duniyaaru boo nyaami.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:17.328
Sey ɓe nyiɓi nokkuure mawɗe, ɓe maɓɓiti gese.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:32.666
Kanjum woni gariiri arandeeji. Wakkati maajum, ɓikkoy maayi.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:01.656
Debbo'en ɓen hoo'i leydi e kaaƴe leɗɗe cukalel, ɓe ɓanngini mahol.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:11.944
Kamɓe ɓe ngaɗi laabi daga dow ngam walaa mo wi'a to ɓe ƴiwoy.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.704
Baabiraawo meeɗen wari diga dow.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:49.824
Caggal ɗum, laamiiɗo Tibelel ɓadake.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.032
Non, moye waɗi walluuji ɗi'e?

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.152
Hannde, rewɓe nder Tibeel ɗon ɓesda cuuɗi maɓɓe.
